      "content": "self-care isn't going to fix the fact that i'm essentially a social pariah for doing what was right. it's more than just being tired, it's like... i look at the future and there's just no version of it where it's okay again. if being a good person just means being alone and broken, then what was the point of any of it? it feels like i'm just waiting for something to finally end.",
